      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "💡 MENTAL MODEL:  GC = BFS through the pointer graph. Roots → grey → scan → black. Unreached = white = free.\n                  STW pauses in modern Go: 100μs–1ms (sub-millisecond!). Not your grandfather's GC.\n                  GOGC=100 means: trigger GC when heap = 2× live heap from the last cycle.",
