      "text": "✓ REMEMBER:  GOMEMLIMIT (Go 1.19+) = soft memory limit, auto-tunes GC trigger frequency\n             runtime/trace + go tool trace visualizes GC pauses and STW events\n             Reduce GC pressure: fewer allocations, sync.Pool, value types over pointers",
